&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR_GWCOCGICY9TqKd8SrYOUG6OiboAJGwtsx3nCl8zO1g&oe=6B0C6BBB"}, {"file_name": "com.oculus.vrshell-20261122-002039.png", "id": "1042933985496757", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839692_1042933988830090_8951490655451391437_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=71k-OEbbQWAQ7kNvwE1Q-CP&_nc_oc=Adorzl78H9aj2KXpxMdvzKEf92VGDuPa38b8rZkpwncylIyTU6KxGO-tUGzvoEFUhlM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT42Hr9sDyju-M4CSB7-vawRPiPRYM6yhejkpVAaIHtbQ&oe=6B0C63DF"}, {"file_name": "com.oculus.vrshell-20261122-002051.png", "id": "3390532807814590", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839705_3390532811147923_5322672769003900574_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wFsExJxKZhgQ7kNvwF5w0oc&_nc_oc=Adrspais0kekitoEM6WyhLzCM-sISa9CKNRa5a5AqqSbTAmUbz5cJkcr9Bx_lL2521M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR7oaABjcH1U4bCi0T2MuP5wci6ICvfiJMVPk_Nx-f1yw&oe=6B0C5C75"}, {"file_name": "com.oculus.vrshell-20261122-002115.png", "id": "942777755437168", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839689_942777762103834_4357119948851471872_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IvQLoQdnCcsQ7kNvwGJaFkG&_nc_oc=Adqd8llM52sjn1IRL49eSC8Awtoco-ZkK42WFLf-dxof3EbvJ108XtyIFFwLtaULsKo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTKQDscKb9mecyTld5Si0UhM_GKx0jbW4DneLZf7mCiLw&oe=6B0C5439"}, {"file_name": "com.oculus.vrshell-20261122-002059.png", "id": "3151879068320383", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908839713_3151879071653716_6331511410783442735_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ex1DpCqYZqIQ7kNvwFVeOsb&_nc_oc=AdqK8HpXjgcFmvr8Ydb1gU1BgWlC6OCboE8FuZXwqX-Og1VKN_Z3FQOxUc-JBSdMhX8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQh73lX46kUAWS4qX6NSrnBV5k5B4SKVwi24XF9wUedkw&oe=6B0C537A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "OmokageFaceTracking", "keywords": ["omoai", "omokage", "facetracking"], "long_description": "# Bring every expression to life\n\nOmokage is a face-tracking companion app built for VRChat. It connects compatible USB face-tracking hardware to the Omokage Windows app over your local network, so your avatar can mirror your expressions in real time.\n\nNo camera or computer? Open Expression Studio on your headset. Use sliders to animate a virtual character, save your favorite expressions as presets, and record and replay animations up to 10 seconds long.\n\n## High performance, low overhead\n\nEfficient capture and streaming keep resource usage low while delivering smooth face tracking.\n\n## Precise tracking, natural expression\n\nAI inference on your PC captures subtle facial movements to bring your avatar to life\n\n## Wireless streaming, flexible setup\n\nConnect your headset and PC to the same local network, pair them, and get started without connecting your face-tracking hardware directly to your PC\n\n## Simple and intuitive\n\nClear device and connection status lets you focus on playing and connecting with others\n\n__Requires compatible face-tracking hardware__", "short_description": "Connect your face-tracking hardware to your PC for precise, smooth VRChat expressions with low resource usage"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1867575557999251", "locale": "zh_HK", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "OFT \u9762\u5f71", "keywords": ["oft", "omokage", "omoai", "facetracking"], "long_description": "# \u8b93\u6bcf\u4e00\u500b\u8868\u60c5\uff0c\u90fd\u81ea\u7136\u50b3\u9054\n\n\u9762\u5f71\u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u5c08\u70ba VRChat \u6253\u9020\u7684\u81c9\u90e8\u8ffd\u8e64\u914d\u5957\u61c9\u7528\u7a0b\u5f0f\uff0c\u9023\u63a5\u76f8\u5bb9\u7684 USB \u9762\u6355\u88dd\u7f6e\uff0c\u900f\u904e\u5340\u57df\u7db2\u8def\u8207\u96fb\u8166\u7248\u9762\u5f71\u642d\u914d\uff0c\u5c07\u4f60\u7684\u81c9\u90e8\u52d5\u4f5c\u8f49\u5316\u70ba\u865b\u64ec\u4e16\u754c\u4e2d\u7684\u5373\u6642\u8868\u60c5\n\n## \u9ad8\u6548\u80fd\uff0c\u4f4e\u8cc7\u6e90\u5360\u7528\n\n\u9ad8\u6548\u7387\u64f7\u53d6\u8207\u50b3\u8f38\uff0c\u6e1b\u5c11\u88dd\u7f6e\u8cc7\u6e90\u5360\u7528\uff0c\u8b93\u8868\u60c5\u8ffd\u8e64\u6d41\u66a2\u904b\u4f5c\n\n## \u7cbe\u6e96\u6355\u6349\uff0c\u81ea\u7136\u8868\u9054\n\n\u642d\u914d\u96fb\u8166\u7aef AI \u63a8\u8ad6\uff0c\u6355\u6349\u7d30\u5fae\u7684\u81c9\u90e8\u8b8a\u5316\uff0c\u8b93\u865b\u64ec\u5316\u8eab\u66f4\u751f\u52d5\n\n## \u7121\u7dda\u50b3\u8f38\uff0c\u81ea\u7531\u9023\u63a5\n\n\u982d\u6234\u88dd\u7f6e\u8207\u96fb\u8166\u9023\u4e0a\u540c\u4e00\u5340\u57df\u7db2\u8def\uff0c\u5b8c\u6210\u914d\u5c0d\u5373\u53ef\u4f7f\u7528\uff0c\u7121\u9808\u5c07\u9762\u6355\u88dd\u7f6e\u76f4\u63a5\u9023\u63a5\u96fb\u8166\n\n## \u7c21\u6f54\u76f4\u89ba\uff0c\u8f15\u9b06\u4f7f\u7528\n\n\u6e05\u695a\u5448\u73fe\u88dd\u7f6e\u8207\u9023\u7dda\u72c0\u614b\uff0c\u8b93\u4f60\u5c08\u6ce8\u65bc\u904a\u6232\u548c\u4ea4\u6d41\n\n__\u4f7f\u7528\u9700\u914d\u5099\u76f8\u5bb9\u7684 USB \u9762\u6355\u88dd\u7f6e__", "short_description": "\u9023\u63a5\u9762\u6355\u88dd\u7f6e\uff0c\u5c07\u81c9\u90e8\u52d5\u4f5c\u5373\u6642\u50b3\u8f38\u81f3\u96fb\u8166\uff0c\u70ba VRChat \u5e36\u4f86\u7cbe\u6e96\u3001\u6d41\u66a2\u3001\u4f4e\u8cc7\u6e90\u5360\u7528\u7684\u8868\u60c5\u8ffd\u8e64\u9ad4\u9a57"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1841478850500912", "locale": "zh_TW", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "OFT \u9762\u5f71", "keywords": ["oft", "omoai", "omokage", "facetracking"], "long_description": "# \u8b93\u6bcf\u4e00\u500b\u8868\u60c5\uff0c\u90fd\u81ea\u7136\u50b3\u9054\n\n\u9762\u5f71\u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u5c08\u70ba VRChat \u6253\u9020\u7684\u81c9\u90e8\u8ffd\u8e64\u914d\u5957\u61c9\u7528\u7a0b\u5f0f\uff0